[{"title":"杂诗 其一","author":"何绛","text":"翡翠生南方，羽毛未为彩。\n装载上两京，声价踰数倍。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":41584,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"杂诗 其二","author":"何绛","text":"我家有宝剑，铸成匪一朝。\n珍藏虽未用，奇气常干霄。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":41585,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"短歌","author":"何绛","text":"丰盈盛饰女，布素淡妆人。\n不分在颜色，只分富与贫。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":41586,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"得姓初祖","author":"何绛","text":"扁舟来往绣溪津，一字荒唐已避秦。\n翻觉桃源人更拙，举家何用绝交亲。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":41587,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"入粤始祖","author":"何绛","text":"仙穜来自迟结子，开基岭表泽何深。\n须知亿万筹难尽，总在当年一片心。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":41588,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"中散大夫祖","author":"何绛","text":"十载心知莽伪真，松兹一谪见纯臣。\n可怜廉吏廉何甚，身后衣冠尚与人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":41589,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"云浮镇将祖","author":"何绛","text":"慷慨当年已寡俦，铜符拜命出云浮。\n无多号令身随死，教得溪蛮泪尽流。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":41590,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"千牛将军宁国伯祖","author":"何绛","text":"安史成擒勋业吁，九重封拜主恩殊。\n阳山赐得连云第，曾及蓬莱阙下无。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":41591,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"经略祖","author":"何绛","text":"匹马招降岂偶然，观星早已识亡存。\n谁知事去千年后，出处犹宜法祖言。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":41592,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"太常祖","author":"何绛","text":"一第中朝大义彰，数将封事悟明庄。\n河阳邸第三千里，祇为君亲去故乡。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":41593,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"侍御祖","author":"何绛","text":"岭头七度荐杯羹，剑履威严耀两楹。\n昨日韶阳滩上过，浪声犹似不平鸣。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":41594,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"恭人李氏祖母","author":"何绛","text":"军储七日继天仓，小部君臣迎食浆。\n若遇汉高时定赏，酂侯功业定相方。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":41595,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"汉上寄别毛子霞","author":"何绛","text":"黄鹄矶边水急流，轻舠又向秣陵浮。\n离心托尽晴川鸟，曾入城中君听不。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":41596,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"饶平留别陈巩宁","author":"何绛","text":"山城一月绪如丝，杯酒临行强共持。\n却指林中霜叶别，相逢应在着花时。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":41597,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"经林德丛村居","author":"何绛","text":"竹窗高柳锁秋烟，君在湖中第几船。\n亭上不劳双鹤放，扁舟人已下前川。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":41598,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"泰山无字碑","author":"何绛","text":"秦帝东封出奉符，天孙碑碣倚云孤。\n当年尚未经坑火，此日如何一字无。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":41599,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"越裳道中","author":"何绛","text":"路转斜阳入翠微，轻车只与鸟争飞。\n春风共看王孙草，南北游人总未归。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":41600,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"东山访彭孟侯","author":"何绛","text":"绿树林中石径欹，竹窗高掩少人知。\n阴符读罢香烟细，溪鸟惊飞客到时。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":41601,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"孤山吊胡烈妇墓 其一","author":"何绛","text":"白杨秋尽叶初黄，马鬣萧萧感叹长。\n两月未忘粒并绝，十旬为妇药亲尝。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":41602,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"孤山吊胡烈妇墓 其二","author":"何绛","text":"身随黄壤心何烈，冢葬青山骨亦香。\n却恨世间公道少，不将巾帼易冠裳。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":41603,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"孤山吊胡烈妇墓 其三","author":"何绛","text":"于归不负许身时，一语随君未敢欺。\n地下若逢前代主，休将底事与他知。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":41604,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题豫章叶徂徕扁舟图","author":"何绛","text":"波寒日暮罢垂纶，独放扁舟俟水滨。\n最恨伍员亡楚后，芦中无复渡江人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":41605,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送李方水掌教临皋 其一","author":"何绛","text":"一官虽远未为贫，海漆花开岛上春。\n教罢诸生酌椰酒，籧篨布地引儿嚬。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":41606,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送李方水掌教临皋 其二","author":"何绛","text":"四时风物似春温，俗俭人淳古道存。\n此地欲愁愁不得，城边尚有买愁村。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":41607,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送李方水掌教临皋 其三","author":"何绛","text":"看来两鬓渐成霜，虽是心孤老亦忙。\n浮海十年曾有兴，因君还得散愁肠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":41608,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送李方水掌教临皋 其四","author":"何绛","text":"半岁西湖旅食身，缄诗遥寄越溪滨。\n澹庵泉道清无比，留待穷交一故人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":41609,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄岑金纪时客琼南 其一","author":"何绛","text":"故里书从江上来，闻君二月海船开。\n莫嫌须鬓皤然白，逢着鸡窠当小孩。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":41610,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄岑金纪时客琼南 其二","author":"何绛","text":"花梨树底醉颜酡，嚼罢槟榔发浩歌。\n虽是六时惊巨浪，人间何处不风波。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":41611,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄会同广文吴惠远 其一","author":"何绛","text":"梅花谷里别鸣驺，君去琼州我惠州。\n双鬓白来君似我，盐梅还是属君侯。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":41612,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄会同广文吴惠远 其二","author":"何绛","text":"感君赠我沉香根，水玉苍文异众芬。\n怀袖至今香未散，依稀出入每逢君。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":41613,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄李素公","author":"何绛","text":"一首新诗寄所思，通衢无水鲤鱼迟。\n诗成自愧非奇丽，未敢劳君付雪儿。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":41614,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题湘江秋霁图 其一","author":"何绛","text":"湘山重叠倚天开，湘水悠悠去不回。\n一自屈平吟泽畔，千年无复有人来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":41615,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题湘江秋霁图 其二","author":"何绛","text":"江皋落叶正悲秋，石壁千寻碧涧流。\n几欲问天天未醒，楚人工怨亦工愁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":41616,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题湘江秋霁图 其三","author":"何绛","text":"数间茅屋掩秋村，地回从无车马喧。\n自是独醒人共弃，非关日午不开门。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":41617,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题湘江秋霁图 其四","author":"何绛","text":"湘江水阔雁声多，欲济无舟可奈何。\n满把相思言未敢，一生心事托微波。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":41618,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"客中送王本直归广州 其一","author":"何绛","text":"滩头立马送王郎，草色青青柳色黄。\n我亦珠江江口住，欲将乡梦寄归装。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":41619,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"客中送王本直归广州 其二","author":"何绛","text":"桃花浪头似雪堆，艓工初从合水开。\n后夜月明翘首望，依稀渐见越王台。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":41620,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送豫章梁质人入秦 其一","author":"何绛","text":"萧萧匹马去江浔，落叶纷纷秋又深。\n三尺腰间聊解赠，感君一片入秦心。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":41621,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送豫章梁质人入秦 其二","author":"何绛","text":"从来豪杰言形胜，欲塞函关祇一丸。\n今日车书安事此，长杨秋雨渐声寒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":41622,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄潘亦庶兼柬金纪时同客琼州","author":"何绛","text":"小袖罗衣白玉钩，桄榔夹道好淹留。\n归来但得盈车果，莫遣张郎学浪游。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":41623,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送江南杭简夫之肇庆 其一","author":"何绛","text":"两岸风吹入峡船，崧台明月正娟娟。\n端州太守怜才甚，江阁应多赋大篇。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":41624,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送江南杭简夫之肇庆 其二","author":"何绛","text":"羚羊峡口烂柯山，仙子棋枰尚未残。\n近日岁时容易厌，倘逢弹局不妨看。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":41625,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄容廷恂 其一","author":"何绛","text":"永夜怀人独不眠，秋风吹上小窗前。\n银河岁岁无清浅，书札须将寄客船。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":41626,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄容廷恂 其二","author":"何绛","text":"欲泛扁舟访斐园，青山重叠带烟村。\n蒹葭秋水苍苍外，所谓伊人定倚门。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":41627,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送岑圣眉北上 其一","author":"何绛","text":"日上三竿门始开，野人事事久心灰。\n闻君万里献书去，相送河梁不忍回。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":41628,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送岑圣眉北上 其二","author":"何绛","text":"满天风雪一行人，赋别谁能有老亲。\n怪得临岐重惆怅，杏花开在隔年春。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":41629,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送岑圣眉北上 其三","author":"何绛","text":"曲江宴后袖香微，赐马春深骑渐肥。\n天子好文知眷重，定因白发诏先归。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":41630,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送谭目衡游龙川 其一","author":"何绛","text":"别日常多见日稀，霜林落叶正飞飞。\n期君得似秋来雁，岁岁辞家岁岁归。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":41631,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送谭目衡游龙川 其二","author":"何绛","text":"过尽东江数十程，题诗日上赵佗城。\n閒来若作还家梦，先向先人丘垄行。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":41632,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"广州竹枝辞 其一","author":"何绛","text":"蟛子春肥百舌啼，老渔歌唱白鹅西。\n莫倚近年波浪稳，蚩尤风起石门低。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":41633,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"广州竹枝辞 其二","author":"何绛","text":"月泉寺口月明时，一叠秋风一叠词。\n今夜思君不得见，坐看孤月上高枝。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":41634,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"广州竹枝辞 其三","author":"何绛","text":"妾家旧住青枫桥，日见王孙马饮潮。\n何事王孙别妾去，早潮仍长暮潮消。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":41635,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"广州竹枝辞 其四","author":"何绛","text":"虎头日出尚曈昽，艓子齐开上大通。\n借问狂夫何处去，锦帆都趁五更风。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":41636,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"广州竹枝辞 其五","author":"何绛","text":"坡山渡口春草齐，番山谢豹山中啼。\n可怜一夜潇潇雨，犹向东风忆蜀西。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":41637,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"广州竹枝辞 其六","author":"何绛","text":"一亩花田倚郭边，鸟啼花发自年年。\n昌华冷落诸陵坏，空有香魂尚俨然。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":41638,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"广州竹枝辞 其七","author":"何绛","text":"送郎莫过琵琶洲，琵琶本出韩凭愁。\n妾自有心防触着，那知郎意在东流。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":41639,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"广州竹枝辞 其八","author":"何绛","text":"河南十五采菱女，相约踏歌踏早潮。\n木兰为楫沙棠桨，日出东方烟雾消。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":41640,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"续奁 其一","author":"何绛","text":"深宵拚胆自家行，豆蔻梢头月渐生。\n常恐小奴竹外过，瞰人踪迹最分明。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":41641,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"续奁 其二","author":"何绛","text":"见欢蹋影夜窗边，暂歇琵琶不上弦。\n自觉语言殊不细，东姑犹喜尚痴眠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":41642,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送沈山隐将军出镇石龙 其一","author":"何绛","text":"仙湖街口月徘徊，暂醉兰陵酒百杯。\n横海勋名何足异，罗浮山色帐前来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":41643,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送沈山隐将军出镇石龙 其二","author":"何绛","text":"一军暂出尉佗城，晓日东江组练明。\n天子只今方北顾，炎州瘴疠付君清。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":41644,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送沈山隐将军出镇石龙 其三","author":"何绛","text":"暇日辕门鼓角休，银鞍白马猎高秋。\n怪来少妇誇夫婿，千骑东方居上头。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":41645,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送容廷恂客韶","author":"何绛","text":"绿护山头绿渐匀，黄云山下绿醅新。\n千钟倾尽出门去，江树青青愁杀人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":41646,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"象山怀古 其一","author":"何绛","text":"文献无如今尹神，百年耳目一朝新。\n亦缘向日人心古，偏信人间白发人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":41647,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"象山怀古 其二","author":"何绛","text":"洪武年初忆谢公，书堂西筑墨池东。\n高皇寸土烟消尽，谁保当时一亩宫。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":41648,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄小金山敏言上人","author":"何绛","text":"百里灵洲水拍天，小金一点望如船。\n纸窗竹屋清阴下，中有高僧最少年。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":41649,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠箕公新筑草阁","author":"何绛","text":"缚竹编茅倚定山，柴门曾设不须关。\n老僧入定宵分后，空有江楼日往还。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":41650,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"江上酒楼口占送肇楚归冈州","author":"何绛","text":"江树萧萧送客秋，片帆斜日下冈州。\n今宵只是前宵月，管尔清光不上楼。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":41651,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送汪十三南湘之惠州 其一","author":"何绛","text":"三日东江是惠州，片帆随雁过罗浮。\n怜君今夜不得睡，独自高吟水驿头。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":41652,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送汪十三南湘之惠州 其二","author":"何绛","text":"西湖秋尽叶如烧，画舫清歌出六桥。\n莫上孤山频吊古，朝云坟上草萧萧。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":41653,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送汪十三南湘之惠州 其三","author":"何绛","text":"白鹤峰头秋色多，木鹅城下横秋波。\n罗衣轻薄秋风起，客子少年当奈何。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":41654,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寿玄捷长老","author":"何绛","text":"六旬长老少如童，坐断天湖第几峰。\n若道此中端的事，三间茅屋五更钟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":41655,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"剃发诵为澄月上人出世 其一","author":"何绛","text":"利刀剃发发皆空，空去还生发不穷。\n剃是本师今日剃，生从未出母胎中。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":41656,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"剃发诵为澄月上人出世 其二","author":"何绛","text":"因缘大事莫逡巡，今日君身即佛身。\n切莫自誇独尊我，云门一棒最惊人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":41657,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"感秋 其一","author":"何绛","text":"黄木湾前水急流，西风吹断海门秋。\n可怜盼盼才高绝，不及题诗燕子楼。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":41658,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"感秋 其二","author":"何绛","text":"赵尉城头数雁飞，连云宫殿掩朱扉。\n炎州岁岁多芳草，从此王孙怨亦稀。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":41659,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"感秋 其三","author":"何绛","text":"贪泉旧与石门邻，涓滴尝来亦愈贫。\n独怪山灵太轻薄，不分一杓故乡人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":41660,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"感秋 其四","author":"何绛","text":"千载良谋何太劳，夕阳城下水滔滔。\n古来难得刘弘度，十六王头授佩刀。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":41661,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"感秋 其五","author":"何绛","text":"伪汉花田一望秋，素馨栽罢美人愁。\n阎罗法密民犹在，百粤王孙几姓刘。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":41662,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}}]